<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 1.7 points to 904.4.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 1.7 points to 904.4.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 1.7 points on Thursday to 904.4, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the food index losing most, down 11.8 points to 1,269.7.</p>
<p>Two indices rose, with the investment funds index rising most, up 11.5 points to 1,114.7.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
